      "content": "This policy change requires immediate attention, and within the next 48 hours, your primary focus should be on fully liquidating all active positions. This involves executing trades to sell or close positions, ensuring that all assets are converted into cash, in order to meet the cash-only state requirement. To initiate liquidation, please verify and update your position data to ensure accurate withholding of all funds.",
